        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fantastic 4 bedroom detached bungalow that provides extensive and well presented accommodation throughout. This private rural location, situated on a matured site gives you the opportunity for peace and quiet set amongst C. 0.48 acres of its own grounds. The property offers light filled rooms with excellent entertaining space extending to c. 165 sq.m. (1,776 sq.ft.). The local town of Ardee is only 5 minutes drive away and has a variety of supermarkets, restaurants and amenities. This property is ideally suited to anyone seeking to relocate to a fabulous rural setting yet close to all the amenities that Ardee, Dunleer (11 mins) & Collon (8 mins) have to offer. The M1 motorway is c. 15 minute's drive from the property giving access to the Dublin-Belfast corridor. Viewing Is Highly Recommended.\n\nAMV 435,000 For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures\n4 Bedroom Detached Bungalow\nExtends to c. 165 sq. m. (c. 1,776 sq. ft.)\nBuilt C. 1992\nC. 0.48 Acre Site\nHigh Speed Broadband\nO-F-C-H High Efficiency Boiler C. 2 Years \nSolid Fuel Stove w/ Back Boiler Unit\nMixed Double & Triple Glazing Throughout\nUpgraded Cavity Wall Insulation\nStira Staircase to Attic Storage x 2\nPartially Floored Attic Storage \nWaste Septic Tank\nWater Mains Supply\nStoned Driveway\nElectric Security Gates & Intercom\nMatured Landscaped Gardens\nWest Facing Side Patio Seating Area\nFully Private Surrounding Aspects\nAmple Parking\nBlock Built Shed (7.18m x 5.70m)\n\nAccommodation Includes\nEntrance Hallway\nLiving Room(3.94m x 4.42m)\nKitchen/Dining (5.46m x 3.63m)\nUtility(1.51m x 2.51m)\nRear Utility(3.65m x 2.14m)\nBedroom 1(3.62m x 3.90m)\nEn Suite (1.03m x 2.70m)\nBedroom 2(3.31m x 4.42m)\nWalk-In-Wardrobe(1.56m x 3.27m)\nBedroom 3(3.33m x 3.43m)\nBedroom 4(3.34m x 3.01m)\nOffice / Games Room(3.68m x 3.18m)\nMain Bathroom (3.65m x 2.73m)\n\nBuilding Energy Rating\nBER: B3\nBER No. 119190825\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 134.44 kWh/m²/yr\n\nViewing Details \nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent.\n\n"
